    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631-a3">

                <pb facs="0752" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg666"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Light to Mr.
                            Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consular Agency of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Guadalajara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1903-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                5, 1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I can not learn that the murderer of John E. Week has been apprehended, or that
                    efforts are being made to apprehend him.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward B. Light.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
